    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.4</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 18:31:14 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>10004</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>• Add Files screen now shows live per-file progress with inline Retry for failures
• Overall vs current-file progress side by side
• Settings split per format: video/audio segment length, PDF pages-per-request, image notes, concurrent requests
• Fixed MP3 scanning (was failing due to AVFoundation passthrough)
• Library: Search-in-folder and Rescan buttons now wired
• Search filter bar is always visible</p>]]></description>
